{"id":"n73061-1-8","stage":5,"title":"일간지 · 日报","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73061-1-8-1","ko":"나 다음 달부터 일간지에 사설을 싣기로 했어.","zh":"从下个月起，我要给一家日报写社论了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"달부터","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달부터","audio":"/audio/4d47bba84a67faecda3e.mp3"}},{"text":"일간지에","meaning":"日报","explanation":"일간지：日报；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"일간지","audio":"/audio/866f8cf02e47742281f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73061","senseId":"1","lemma":"일간지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일간지에","audio":"/audio/9ff40134a5c9ba7ea81f.mp3"}},{"text":"사설을","meaning":"社论","explanation":"사설：社论；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사설","audio":"/audio/b7d59625438c5e5106cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15663","senseId":"1","lemma":"사설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사설을","audio":"/audio/49bc49c158847caa970a.mp3"}},{"text":"싣기로","meaning":"刊载，登载","explanation":"싣다：刊载，登载；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"싣다","audio":"/audio/0684cd889a2496873125.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58173","senseId":"3","lemma":"싣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싣기로","audio":"/audio/bfeef2e821bd9cbb40f8.mp3"}},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"866f8cf02e477422","term":"일간지","zh":"日报","audio":"/audio/866f8cf02e47742281f9.mp3","entryId":"73061","definition":"每天发行的报纸。","pronunciation":["일간지"]},{"id":"b7d59625438c5e51","term":"사설","zh":"社论","audio":"/audio/b7d59625438c5e5106cc.mp3","entryId":"15663","definition":"报刊杂志上笔者陈述自己主张或意见的文章。","pronunciation":["사설"]},{"id":"0684cd889a249687","term":"싣다","zh":"刊载，登载","audio":"/audio/0684cd889a2496873125.mp3","entryId":"58173","definition":"将文章或照片等在书或报纸上印刷出来。","pronunciation":["싣ː따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"决定","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"把某事定下来。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/872dac962ff2e01b65c6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73061-1-8-2","ko":"축하해! 그런데 매일 글을 쓰려면 꽤 힘들겠다.","zh":"恭喜！不过每天写文章会很辛苦吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"축하해!","meaning":"祝贺，庆贺，道贺","explanation":"축하하다：祝贺，庆贺，道贺；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"축하하다","audio":"/audio/ea51af502d96bc7c2645.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63664","senseId":"1","lemma":"축